          "quote": "we reverse those orders that require the DHS to pay foster board payments for periods after the Minor's eighteenth birthday",
          "url": "https://www.courtlistener.com/opinion/1191754/in-interest-of-doe/",
          "courtlistener_cluster_id": 1191754
